  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The International University of Monaco (IUM) is a prestigious private institution nestled in the heart of Monaco. With its strong focus on business, finance, and international relations, you’ll find yourself immersed in a dynamic learning environment. The campus is located along the scenic Mediterranean coast and provides a serene setting.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At IUM, you'll be part of a diverse and inclusive community with students from across the globe. The university offers a wide range of student clubs, organisations, and events. With a variety of student-run initiatives, you'll be able to enhance your student life. Additionally, IUM provides you with personalised counselling services, peer support programs, and access to wellness resources to help you maintain a balanced student life.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>While the university does not provide on-campus housing, IUM collaborates with several local residences and apartments to assist you in finding suitable living arrangements, located near the university.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong></p><p>IUM offers access to a wide range of resources, including e-books, magazines, newspapers, and specialised research databases, all available online 24/7. This ensures that you have the necessary materials to excel in your studies.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong></p><p>IUM has a computer lab and a research department that collaborates with the Group INSEEC Research Laboratory. You’ll also find a research lab at IUM, along with lots of online resources, small classes, and collaborative group projects.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
